  m_text: AgriSense AR is an innovative mobile solution designed to transform plant
    care through the power of Augmented Reality. For many gardeners and small-scale
    farmers, identifying diseases in crops like tomatoes, cucumbers, or apple trees
    is a daunting task that often leads to misdiagnosis and lost harvests. Our mission
    is to bridge this expertise gap by putting a virtual agronomist in every user's
    pocket, turning complex botanical data into actionable, visual insights.
